# Guardian Project's "if" is asked again as the ability resolves (CR 603.4; the 2019-01-25 ruling): Bot1's Grizzly Bears
# enters as the first of its name, so the ability triggers, but Bot2 bolts it in response. As the ability resolves the
# Grizzly Bears card is in Bot1's graveyard - a creature card of the same name - so Bot1 draws nothing.

